doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22107282
version: v1.0.0
date-released: '2026-08-26'
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline, derived data and validation record for a study of
  what becomes of false-positive exclusions after they are added to a
  public detection-rule repository. Suppression is detected semantically
  by a deterministic test over the set of predicates a rule holds under
  negation, rather than by structural comparison of rule text. Includes
  the 120-item blinded validation sample and its labels.
